  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "きんねん　もくげきれいが　ある。イダイナキバという　なは　あるほんにしるされた　せいぶつから　とられた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "근년에 목격된 사례가 있다. “위대한엄니”라는 이름은 어떤 책에 기록된 생물에게서 따온 것이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "近年曾經有人目擊到牠。雄偉牙這個名字來自於某本書裡記載的生物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon a été aperçu à plusieurs reprises ces dernières années. Son nom s’inspire d’une créature évoquée dans un certain livre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In den letzten Jahren gab es Sichtungen dieses Pokémon. Eine Kreatur aus einem gewissen Buch stand Pate für den Namen Riesenzahn.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Testigos afirman haberlo visto recientemente. El nombre Colmilargo está tomado de una criatura mencionada en cierto libro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Alcuni riportano di averlo avvistato negli ultimi anni. Il nome \"Grandizanne\" deriva da quello di una creatura descritta in un certo libro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sightings of this Pokémon have occurred in recent years. The name Great Tusk was taken from a creature listed in a certain book.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "近年　目撃例が　ある。イダイナキバという　名は　ある本に記された　生物から　取られた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "近年有人目击到它。雄伟牙这个名字来自于某本书里记载的生物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Testigos afirman haberlo visto recientemente. El nombre Colmilargo está tomado de una criatura mencionada en cierto libro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "たいこから　いきつづけているとオカルトざっしが　しょうかいしたなぞの　ポケモンに　にている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "태곳적부터 살아 있었다며 오컬트 잡지에 소개됐던 정체불명의 포켓몬을 닮았다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "長得就像是超自然雜誌曾介紹的自太古以來就存活至今的謎之寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ressemble à un Pokémon mystérieux qui, selon une revue consacrée aux phénomènes paranormaux, existerait depuis la nuit des temps.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es gleicht einem geheimnisvollen Pokémon, das einer esoterischen Zeitschrift zufolge seit grauer Vorzeit überdauert haben soll.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su aspecto recuerda al de un extraño Pokémon de origen primitivo que apareció en un artículo de cierta revista esotérica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Somiglia a un Pokémon enigmatico che, stando a una rivista di paranormale, esiste fin da tempi antichissimi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This creature resembles a mysterious Pokémon that, according to a paranormal magazine, has lived since ancient times.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "太古から　生き続けているとオカルト雑誌が　紹介した謎の　ポケモンに　似ている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "长得就像是超自然杂志曾介绍的自太古以来就存活至今的神秘宝可梦。",
      "language": {
